GLTron Faithful Remaster @GLTRON_DISPLAY_VERSION@

Run ./bin/gltron from the extracted archive. The executable finds the included
share/gltron assets relative to its location; it also works from another
working directory. Run ./bin/gltron --help for command-line help.

This @CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME@ @CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR@ build uses @GLTRON_SDL_BACKEND@
@GLTRON_SDL_VERSION@, OpenGL, and libpng. Audio: @GLTRON_AUDIO_DESCRIPTION@.
Install these runtime libraries with your distribution's package manager.
Graphics drivers and system shared libraries are not bundled in this archive.

The original controls, gameplay, assets and music remain available. Preferences
use ~/.gltronrc by default. GLTRON_CONFIG_DIR selects a separate preferences
directory; GLTRON_SCREENSHOT_DIR selects where screenshots are saved.

COPYING contains the license; licenses/LUA-COPYRIGHT.txt contains the bundled
Lua notice. build-info.txt records the build configuration.
The share/applications and share/icons directories contain desktop integration
files for installations into a standard system or user-local prefix.
